  (text "3.0 V display logic and common I2C pull-ups.\nSSD1309 logic max = 3.3 V; existing buck worst case ~3.39 V.\n3.0 V HIGH levels also meet the 3.3 V devices' thresholds.\nOne populated pair of I2C pull-ups. Bus speed: 100 kHz.\nNo I2C multiplexer is needed; addresses are distinct."
    (at 20.32 188.0 0)
